Terminal themes

The palettes in src/tesota-shell-theme.ts adapt the visual direction of
packages/operator-appearance/src/palettes.ts from Kiln commit
f02c70b6c312e22f76edf912902e8efaa8aa736a (kiln-legacy-2026-09).
Kiln credited Automata, Phosphor and Vesper to the community themes at
https://github.com/SunkenInTime/t3-themes. Tesota's terminal implementation
does not copy that gallery's source code or theme JSON. Status colors,
message backgrounds and selections are adapted to Tesota's terminal roles;
the GUI appearance infrastructure is not included.

